  "summary": "Duffy disclosed 39 transactions dated Feb. 3, 2025 to March 31, 2025, consisting of 38 sales (estimated $703K) and one purchase (estimated $8K), for an estimated cumulative total of $711K across all tracked filings. The largest single transaction was a sale of KKR Private Equity Conglomerate LLC (K-PEC), reported in a range with an estimated midpoint in the $100,001 to $250,000 bracket. Microsoft (MSFT) was the most-traded asset, appearing in two transactions. One of the 39 transactions, or 3 percent, was filed late, meaning OGE was notified more than 30 days after Duffy was notified of the trade.",
